        pain3Title: "The agent's memory is 'its', not 'yours'",
        pain3Body: "Stop using it and the accumulation is gone — the butler's memories aren't the master's.",
        painsAnswer: "CognitiveOS's answer: take YOUR cognition out of the agent, and keep it in your own hands.",
        aboutTitle: "If AI is silicon life, does it need a 'brain structure'?",
        aboutLead: "The master's original vision text (from ChatGPT session, 2026-08-10)",
