        aboutH3: "📊 A reporting developer's example",
        aboutP3: "Oracle problem → database experience. Reporting request → reporting design logic. Performance issue → SQL tuning experience.",
        aboutP4: "But today's AI agent Memory: all chat logs → one memory store → full-text search. Result: remembers but can't classify; has info but doesn't know when to recall; knows the past but can't form an experience system.",
        aboutH4: "🚀 Next-gen AI may not just grow parameters",
        aboutP5: "It may grow to resemble the brain: functional modules, agents collaborating like brain regions communicate.",
        aboutWork: "job skills, project experience, domain knowledge",
        aboutCreative: "inspiration, ideas, content creation",
        aboutLearn: "knowledge accumulation & growth path",
        aboutMem: "organise life experience into long-term memory",
        aboutP6: "Maybe the truly powerful AI is not one that 'knows everything', but one that 'knows when to call which capability'.",
        aboutH5: "📖 Series preview: 'What would AI still lack to become digital life?'",
        series1: "Why AI needs a 'hippocampus' (long-term memory)",
        series2: "Why AI needs a 'prefrontal cortex' (goal planning)",
